  },
  {
    "key": "ntTitle",
    "en": "What {b} can do now",
    "fr": "Ce que {b} sait faire"
  },
  {
    "key": "ntSub",
    "en": "Each trick is a block. A trick blooms the first time you use it to finish a request. There is no score and nothing wilts.",
